  "description": "The T.E.M.P.O. ÖHLINS EDITION benefits from all the suspension expertise of the Swedish brand, offering a setup that encourages bold, confident handling.\n• The RXF 36 m.2 fork delivers optimal travel and precise handling. The Ramp Up Chamber of the air spring means progressiveness at the end of the travel can be adjusted and the TTX hydraulic cartridge allows high and low speed compression as well as rebound adjustment. The TTX1 Air shock is designed for trail bikes. It benefits from numerous adjustments: air volume, rebound, high and low speed compression and even lock-out. In collaboration with ÖHLINS, we have worked on a specific valve system which releases the full potential of our Virtual Contact System.\n• TRP TRAIL EVO 4-piston brakes are consistent and reliable.\n• With the Synthesis Enduro I9, CRANKBROTHERS offer a pair of aluminium wheels built around INDUSTRY NINE hubs. The stiffness is differentiated between the front and rear to optimise Grip and stability.\n• A SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain and 10-52t cassette mean climbing is a breeze.",
